  m_Name: unit_840258
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Deimos the Undaunted
  unitId: 840258
  unitNumber: 8618
  description: "Following the utter destruction of Athensphere at the hands of Gazia
    during the Augmentation Wars, the realm was presumed shattered forever, and the
    fate of the brave demigods who fought to the bitter end for their home cast into
    oblivion. However, some scholars believe that their valiant deeds earned them
    the right to enter the everlasting paradise of their old gods, where their forms
    were purged of all mechanical influences.A goliath in the war, Deimos Thunderborn
    was well-known as an engine of destruction against Gazia's Iron Army. He waded
    deep into enemy territory, and every blow from Forgebreaker shattered the earth
    with a resounding clap of thunder. Following the catastrophic conclusion of the
    war, the old gods commended his noble spirit, and thus restored Deimos to his
    original form.Despite his unrivalled strength and imposing stature, Deimos valued
    at his very core peace and harmony above all. A reticent demigod of few words,
    he preferred solitude in the mountains of his birth, honing his metalcraft as
    tribute to his progenitors. Pleased with his piety, the old gods favored him
    as the extension of their material presence. The same great spirits he venerated
    while in his mortal shell are now attributed to him\u2014embodied within the
    roaring visage of the noble lion cresting the hammer of the gods that he now
    wields.Now and forever in the paradise of the Golden City, Deimos is revered
    as a paragon of might\u2014not just in body, but in heart, for the strong defend
    their allies through the conviction of their deeds, not the strength of their
    steel."
  summonDesc: Hail, traveler.<br>If you've found your way to this realm,<br>the great
    spirits must smile upon you.
  fusionDesc: The great spirits have heard my call!<br>You have my thanks.
  evoDesc: Strength is not measured in steel,<br>but in the depths of one's heart.
  element: 4
  rarity: 7
